  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 303.04 Public Utilities Exemption",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 303.04 Public Utilities Exemption. The license requirements of this chapter shall not apply to persons performing tasks covered by federal and state regulation of public utilities pursuant to 49 C.F.R. part 192 and Puc 500, rules of the New Hampshire public utilities commission for gas service pursuant to NH RSA 153:36, II.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15",
